\newlabel{fig:qualitative_detections}{{11}{25}{Qualitative BEV predictions from MobilePIXORNeXt on KITTI validation frames \texttt {007038}, \texttt {005571}, and \texttt {006761} (top to bottom). \textbf {Left}: Front-camera images with calibrated projections of predicted BEV footprints, class labels, and confidence scores. \textbf {Right}: Corresponding LiDAR BEV views with predicted oriented footprints and class annotations. Prediction colors are cyan for Car, magenta for Pedestrian, and yellow for Cyclist. The panels visualize predicted footprints rather than full 3D boxes}{figure.11}{}}
